- [ ] Nondiscrimination policies implemented
- [ ] Accessibility accommodations provided
- [ ] Language access services available
- [ ] Complaint procedures functional

#### Program-Specific Requirements
- [Insert funder-specific compliance checklist items]

### 4.2 Documentation Status
- **Participant Files**: [Complete and current percentage]
- **Financial Records**: [Documentation completeness]
- **Timekeeping Records**: [Certification status]
- **Procurement Files**: [Competition documentation]

### 4.3 Monitoring and Evaluation

#### Internal Monitoring
- **Site Visits Conducted**: [Number and findings]
- **File Reviews Completed**: [Sample size and results]
- **Quality Assurance**: [Process improvements]
- **Staff Supervision**: [Performance management]

#### External Evaluation
- **Evaluation Progress**: [Status of evaluation activities]
- **Preliminary Findings**: [Early results if available]
- **Data Quality**: [Reliability and validity assessment]
- **Utilization Plans**: [How findings will be used]

## Section 5: Forward Planning

### 5.1 Next Period Activities

#### Activity Schedule
| Activity | Start Date | End Date | Responsible Party | Resources Needed |
|----------|------------|----------|-------------------|------------------|
| [Activity 1] | | | | |
| [Activity 2] | | | | |
| [Activity 3] | | | | |

#### Risk Assessment
