templates/compliance-attestation.md

```markdown
# Compliance Attestation Statement
*Standardized certification of regulatory compliance for grant recipients*

## Attestation Metadata

### Basic Information
- **Attestation ID**: [Auto-generated]
- **Grant Number**: [Funder-assigned identifier]
- **Grant Period**: [Start Date] to [End Date]
- **Attestation Period**: [Covered timeframe]
- **Attestation Date**: [Date of certification]
- **Organization Name**: [Legal Name]
- **UEI Number**: [Unique Entity Identifier]
- **DUNS Number**: [If applicable]

### Authorized Representatives
#### Primary Certifying Official
- **Name**: [Full Name]
- **Title**: [Position Title]
- **Email**: [Professional Email]
- **Phone**: [Direct Line]
- **Signature Authority**: [Yes/No]

#### Financial Certifying Official
- **Name**: [Full Name]
- **Title**: [Position Title]
- **Email**: [Professional Email]
- **Phone**: [Direct Line]

## Section 1: General Compliance Attestations

### 1.1 Organizational Eligibility
I hereby attest that the organization:

[ ] Is not currently debarred, suspended, or otherwise excluded from receiving federal funds
[ ] Has not been convicted of, or had a civil judgment rendered against it for, fraud or criminal offense in connection with obtaining or performing a federal award
[ ] Is not presently indicted or otherwise criminally or civilly charged for commission of any of the offenses enumerated above
[ ] Has not within a three-year period preceding this application had one or more public transactions terminated for cause or default

### 1.2 Financial Management Systems
I hereby attest that the organization maintains financial management systems that:

[ ] Identify federal awards separately and distinctly
[ ] Record expenditures by budget category and project period
[ ] Provide for accurate, current, and complete disclosure of financial results
[ ] Establish effective internal controls for safeguarding assets
[ ] Compare actual expenditures with budgeted amounts
[ ] Support charges to federal awards with source documentation
- **Last Audit Date**: [Date]
- **Audit Type**: [Single Audit, Program-Specific, Internal]
- **Audit Findings**: [Number of findings, if any]
- **Corrective Action Status**: [Status of resolution]

### 1.3 Procurement Standards
I hereby attest that the organization's procurement procedures:

[ ] Comply with 2 CFR Part 200.317-326 requirements
[ ] Maintain written procurement policies and procedures
[ ] Conduct all procurement transactions in a manner providing full and open competition
[ ] Maintain documentation sufficient to detail procurement history
[ ] Avoid acquisition of unnecessary or duplicative items
[ ] Promote cost-effective use of shared services
- **Procurement Policy Date**: [Last revision date]
- **Conflict of Interest Policy**: [Exists and implemented]
- **Vendor Debarment Checks**: [Routine procedure]

## Section 2: Program-Specific Compliance

### 2.1 Allowable Costs
I hereby attest that all costs charged to the grant are:

[ ] Allowable under the applicable cost principles (2 CFR Part 200, Subpart E)
[ ] Allocable to the grant under generally accepted accounting principles
[ ] Reasonable in amount and necessary for program operations
[ ] Consistently treated across all funding sources
[ ] Supported by adequate documentation
[ ] Incurred during the approved grant period

### 2.2 Time and Effort Reporting
I hereby attest that the organization's timekeeping system:

[ ] Reflects an after-the-fact determination of actual activity
[ ] Accounts for total activity for which employees are compensated
[ ] Is prepared at least monthly and coincides with pay periods
[ ] Is signed by the employee and supervisor
[ ] Reflects distribution of activity by grant or cost objective
[ ] Is maintained in accordance with record retention requirements
- **System Type**: [Electronic/Manual]
- **Certification Frequency**: [Monthly/Quarterly/Semi-annually]
- **Sample Review Conducted**: [Yes/No]
- **Last Review Date**: [Date]

### 2.3 Property Management
I hereby attest that equipment acquired with grant funds:

[ ] Is properly recorded in equipment inventory records
[ ] Is used for authorized purposes during the grant period
[ ] Is adequately maintained and safeguarded
- **Equipment Inventory Updated**: [Date]
- **Annual Physical Inventory Conducted**: [Yes/No]
- **Disposition Plan Established**: [Yes/No]

### 2.4 Program Income
I hereby attest that program income:

[ ] Is identified and recorded separately from other funds
[ ] Is used in accordance with grant terms (additive/deductive)
[ ] Is accounted for in the financial management system
[ ] Is reported on required financial reports
- **Program Income Policy**: [Exists and implemented]
- **Tracking System**: [Description of system]

## Section 3: Civil Rights and Accessibility

### 3.1 Nondiscrimination Compliance
I hereby attest that the organization:

[ ] Does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, sex, age, or disability
[ ] Has implemented required Title VI nondiscrimination policies
[ ] Provides meaningful access to limited English proficient individuals
[ ] Maintains records of complaints and resolutions
- **Nondiscrimination Policy Date**: [Last revision date]
- **Language Access Plan**: [Exists and implemented]
- **Complaints Received This Period**: [Number]

### 3.2 Disability Accessibility
I hereby attest that the organization:

[ ] Complies with Section 504 of the Rehabilitation Act
[ ] Complies with Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) requirements
[ ] Provides reasonable accommodations for participants and employees
[ ] Ensures program accessibility in facilities and services
- **Facility Accessibility Assessment**: [Last conducted date]
- **ADA Coordinator Designated**: [Yes/No]
- **Alternative Format Materials Available**: [Yes/No]

### 3.3 Equal Employment Opportunity
I hereby attest that the organization:

[ ] Maintains equal employment opportunity policies
[ ] Does not discriminate in hiring or employment practices
[ ] Provides reasonable accommodations for employees with disabilities
[ ] Maintains required employment records
- **EEO Policy Date**: [Last revision date]
- **EEO-1 Report Filed**: [If applicable, date]
- **Workforce Demographic Data**: [Maintained and reviewed]

## Section 4: Special Compliance Areas

### 4.1 Lobbying Restrictions
I hereby attest that:

[ ] No federal funds have been used for lobbying activities
[ ] The organization files required lobbying disclosure reports
[ ] The organization complies with Byrd Amendment restrictions
- **Lobbying Disclosure Act Registration**: [If applicable]
- **Reporting Requirements Met**: [Yes/No]

### 4.2 Drug-Free Workplace
I hereby attest that the organization:

[ ] Maintains a drug-free workplace policy
[ ] Provides required notifications to employees
[ ] Takes appropriate personnel actions for violations
[ ] Maintains compliance with Drug-Free Workplace Act
- **Policy Distribution Date**: [Last distribution]
- **Employee Acknowledgment**: [On file]
- **Violations This Period**: [Number, if any]

### 4.3 Environmental Compliance
I hereby attest that the organization:

[ ] Complies with National Environmental Policy Act (NEPA)
[ ] Conducts required environmental reviews for construction
[ ] Maintains compliance with other applicable environmental laws
- **Environmental Review Status**: [Complete/Pending/Not Required]
- **Required Permits Obtained**: [List if applicable]

## Section 5: Monitoring and Reporting

### 5.1 Reporting Compliance
I hereby attest that the organization:

[ ] Submits required reports by established deadlines
[ ] Provides complete and accurate information in reports
[ ] Maintains documentation supporting reported information
[ ] Cooperates with monitoring visits and audits
- **Past Due Reports**: [Number, if any]
- **Report Quality Issues**: [Noted by funder, if any]
- **Monitoring Visit Schedule**: [Last/Next date]

### 5.2 Record Retention
I hereby attest that the organization:

[ ] Maintains records for the required retention period (3 years from final report)
[ ] Secures records against loss, damage, or unauthorized access
[ ] Provides access to records for audit or examination
[ ] Maintains electronic records in accessible formats
- **Record Retention Policy Date**: [Last revision]
- **Storage System Description**: [Physical/Digital/Hybrid]
- **Disaster Recovery Plan**: [Exists and tested]

### 5.3 Subrecipient Monitoring
I hereby attest that for any subawards:

[ ] Risk assessments are conducted before awarding funds
[ ] Written agreements include required flow-down provisions
[ ] Monitoring is conducted based on risk assessment
[ ] Corrective actions are required for identified issues
- **Number of Active Subawards**: [Count]
- **Monitoring Schedule**: [Frequency based on risk]
- **Findings This Period**: [Number, if any]

## Section 6: Certification and Signatures

### 6.1 Comprehensive Certification
I certify that, to the best of my knowledge and belief:

1. All statements and information contained in this attestation are true and correct
2. The organization is in compliance with all applicable federal statutes, regulations, and the terms and conditions of the award
3. All costs charged to the grant are allowable and properly documented
4. The organization has disclosed all required information to the awarding agency
5. The organization accepts responsibility for any disallowed costs resulting from noncompliance

### 6.2 Signature of Authorized Representative

**I understand that false statements or claims may result in civil or criminal penalties, including fines and imprisonment under 18 U.S.C. §§ 287 and 1001.**

**Printed Name**: [Full Name]

**Title**: [Position Title]

**Signature**: _________________________

**Date**: [Date]

### 6.3 Signature of Financial Officer

**Printed Name**: [Full Name]

**Title**: [Position Title]

**Signature**: _________________________

**Date**: [Date]

### 6.4 Witness (Optional)

**Printed Name**: [Full Name]

**Title**: [Position Title]

**Signature**: _________________________

**Date**: [Date]

## Section 7: Supporting Documentation

### Documentation Checklist
The following documentation is maintained and available for review:

#### Financial Documentation
- [ ] Approved budget and subsequent revisions
- [ ] Expenditure ledgers with supporting documentation
- [ ] Time and effort reports with certifications
- [ ] Equipment inventory records
- [ ] Procurement documentation
- [ ] Match contribution documentation

#### Program Documentation
- [ ] Participant eligibility documentation
- [ ] Service delivery records
- [ ] Performance measurement data
- [ ] Monitoring and evaluation reports
- [ ] Subrecipient agreements and monitoring

#### Compliance Documentation
- [ ] Policies and procedures manuals
- [ ] Training records
- [ ] Civil rights compliance documentation
- [ ] Audit reports and corrective action plans
- [ ] Previous monitoring reports

### Document Location
- **Primary Location**: [Address, Room, System]
- **Contact Person**: [Name, Title, Phone]
- **Access Procedures**: [Requirements for access]
- **Retention Schedule**: [Applicable retention period]

## Section 8: Submission

### Submission Instructions
- **Submit to**: [Grantor office/contact]
- **Submission Method**: [Electronic portal/Email/Mail]
- **Due Date**: [Date]
- **Retain Copy**: [Organization retains signed original]

### Acknowledgement
Upon submission, the grantor will:
1. Review the attestation for completeness
2. Follow up on any areas requiring clarification
3. Maintain the attestation in grant files
4. Use the attestation in monitoring and audit activities

### Questions or Revisions
For questions or to report changes in compliance status:
- **Contact**: [Name, Title]
- **Phone**: [Number]
- **Email**: [Address]
- **Required Update Timeline**: [Days after change]

---

*Template Version: 1.3.0*
*Last Updated: [12/29/2025]*
*Based on: 2 CFR Part 200 and OMB Compliance Supplement*
*Legal References: 18 U.S.C. §§ 287, 1001; 31 U.S.C. § 3729*
```





schemas/grant.json

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://grantready.org/schemas/grant/v2.0.0",
  "title": "Grant Data Schema",
  "description": "Standardized schema for grant metadata, terms, and compliance requirements",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "grantId",
    "grantNumber",
    "grantTitle",
    "grantor",
    "recipient",
    "grantPeriod",
    "budget",
    "complianceRequirements"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "metadata": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Schema and document metadata",
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Version of this schema",
          "const": "2.0.0"
        },
        "createdDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "Date and time this grant record was created"
        },
        "lastModifiedDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "Date and time this grant record was last modified"
        },
        "sourceSystem": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "System that created this record"
        },
        "recordId": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Unique identifier for this grant record"
        }
      },
      "required": ["schemaVersion", "createdDate", "recordId"]
    },
    "grantId": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Unique identifier for the grant within the recipient's system"
    },
    "grantNumber": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Official grant number assigned by the grantor"
    },
    "grantTitle": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Official title of the grant",
      "maxLength": 500
    },
    "grantDescription": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Detailed description of the grant purpose and activities"
    },
    "grantType": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Classification of grant type",
      "enum": [
        "formula",
        "discretionary",
        "cooperative agreement",
        "contract",
        "loan",
        "block",
        "categorical",
        "project",
        "research",
        "training",
        "construction",
        "operating",
        "capital",
        "technical assistance",
        "planning"
      ]
    },
    "fundingSource": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Source of funding for the grant",
      "properties": {
        "agency": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Funding agency name"
        },
        "program": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Specific program name"
        },
        "catalogOfFederalDomesticAssistanceNumber": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "CFDA number if federal funding",
          "pattern": "^\\d{2}\\.\\d{3}$"
        },
        "appropriation": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Appropriation bill or source"
        },
        "fundingYear": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Fiscal year of funding"
        }
      },
      "required": ["agency"]
    },
    "grantor": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Entity awarding the grant",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Legal name of grantor"
        },
        "uei": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Unique Entity Identifier",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9]{12}$"
        },
        "duns": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "DUNS number if applicable",
          "pattern": "^\\d{9}$"
        },
        "address": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/address"
        },
        "contact": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/contact"
        }
      },
      "required": ["name"]
    },
    "recipient": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Entity receiving the grant",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Legal name of recipient"
        },
        "uei": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Unique Entity Identifier",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9]{12}$"
        },
        "duns": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "DUNS number if applicable",
          "pattern": "^\\d{9}$"
        },
        "ein": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Employer Identification Number",
          "pattern": "^\\d{2}-\\d{7}$"
        },
        "organizationType": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Type of recipient organization",
          "enum": [
            "nonprofit",
            "governmental_state",
            "governmental_local",
            "governmental_tribal",
            "educational",
            "healthcare",
            "for_profit",
            "individual",
            "other"
          ]
        },
        "address": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/address"
        },
        "contact": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/contact"
        }
      },
      "required": ["name", "uei", "organizationType"]
    },
    "grantPeriod": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Time period for grant performance",
      "properties": {
        "startDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date",
          "description": "Official start date of grant period"
        },
        "endDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date",
          "description": "Official end date of grant period"
        },
        "periodOfPerformance": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Total period of performance in months"
        },
        "budgetPeriods": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "Breakdown of budget periods if different from overall period",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "periodNumber": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "Budget period number"
              },
              "startDate": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date"
              },
              "endDate": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date"
              }
            },
            "required": ["periodNumber", "startDate", "endDate"]
          }
        }
      },
      "required": ["startDate", "endDate"]
    },
    "budget": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Grant budget information",
      "properties": {
        "totalAwardAmount": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "Total amount awarded"
        },
        "federalShare": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "Federal portion of award"
        },
        "nonFederalShare": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "Non-federal portion (match)"
        },
        "budgetCategories": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "Detailed budget by category",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "category": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "personnel",
                  "fringe_benefits",
                  "travel",
                  "equipment",
                  "supplies",
                  "contractual",
                  "construction",
                  "other_direct",
                  "indirect_costs"
                ]
              },
              "amount": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": ["category", "amount"]
          }
        },
        "indirectCostRate": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Indirect cost rate information",
          "properties": {
            "rateType": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["negotiated", "de_minimis", "other"]
            },
            "rate": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "base": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["modified_total_direct_costs", "salaries_and_wages", "other"]
            },
            "agreementNumber": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "expirationDate": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "required": ["totalAwardAmount"]
    },
    "programInformation": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Program-specific information",
      "properties": {
        "programAreas": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "Program area classifications",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "serviceLocations": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "Geographic service locations",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/address"
          }
        },
        "targetPopulation": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Target population demographics",
          "properties": {
            "ageGroups": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "incomeLevels": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "specialPopulations": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "estimatedParticipants": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            }
          }
        },
        "performanceMeasures": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "Required performance measures",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "measureId": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "target": {
                "type": ["number", "string"]
              },
              "frequency": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["quarterly", "semi_annual", "annual", "end_of_grant"]
              }
            },
            "required": ["measureId", "description"]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "complianceRequirements": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Compliance requirements for this grant",
      "properties": {
        "cfrPart200": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Subject to 2 CFR Part 200 requirements"
        },
        "singleAudit": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Subject to Single Audit Act requirements"
        },
        "auditThreshold": {
          "type": "number",
          "description": "Expenditure threshold for audit"
        },
        "specialConditions": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "Special conditions attached to award",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "reportingRequirements": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Reporting requirements",
          "properties": {
            "financialReports": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["quarterly", "semi_annual", "annual", "final"]
            },
            "performanceReports": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["quarterly", "semi_annual", "annual", "final"]
            },
            "inventoryReports": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "closeoutReports": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        },
        "allowedCosts": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Cost allowability information",
          "properties": {
            "equipmentThreshold": {
              "type": "number",
              "description": "Equipment capitalization threshold"
            },
            "priorApprovalRequired": {
              "type": "array",
              "description": "Costs requiring prior approval",
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["equipment", "international_travel", "participant_support", "subawards", "budget_revisions"]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "required": ["cfrPart200"]
    },
    "subawards": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "Subawards under this grant",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "subawardId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "subrecipient": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/organization"
          },
          "amount": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "purpose": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "period": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/dateRange"
          }
        },
        "required": ["subawardId", "subrecipient", "amount"]
      }
    },
    "keyDates": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Important dates for grant management",
      "properties": {
        "applicationSubmitted": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date"
        },
        "awardDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date"
        },
        "obligationDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date"
        },
        "firstDrawdownDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date"
        },
        "nextReportingDueDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date"
        },
        "closeoutDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date"
        },
        "recordRetentionUntil": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date"
        }
      }
    },
    "status": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Current status of the grant",
      "properties": {
        "overallStatus": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "planning",
            "applied",
            "awarded",
            "active",
            "suspended",
            "terminated",
            "closed",
            "completed"
          ]
        },
        "financialStatus": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "no_drawdowns",
            "partial_drawdowns",
            "fully_drawn",
            "overspent",
            "under_spent"
          ]
        },
        "programStatus": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "not_started",
            "in_progress",
            "behind_schedule",
            "on_track",
            "completed",
            "terminated"
          ]
        },
        "complianceStatus": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["compliant", "monitoring", "corrective_action", "non_compliant"]
        },
        "lastStatusUpdate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        }
      },
      "required": ["overallStatus", "lastStatusUpdate"]
    },
    "attachments": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "Documents attached to this grant record",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "documentId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "documentType": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "application",
              "award_notice",
              "budget",
              "report",
              "amendment",
              "correspondence",
              "audit",
              "closeout"
            ]
          },
          "fileName": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "fileType": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "uploadDate": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": ["documentId", "documentType", "fileName", "uploadDate"]
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "address": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "street1": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "street2": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "city": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "state": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z]{2}$"
        },
        "postalCode": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^\\d{5}(-\\d{4})?$"
        },
        "country": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "US"
        }
      },
      "required": ["street1", "city", "state", "postalCode"]
    },
    "contact": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "email": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "email"
        },
        "phone": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^\\+?1?\\d{10}$"
        },
        "phoneExtension": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": ["name", "email"]
    },
    "organization": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "uei": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9]{12}$"
        },
        "organizationType": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": ["name"]
    },
    "dateRange": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "startDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date"
        },
        "endDate": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date"
        }
      },
      "required": ["startDate", "endDate"]
    }
  },
  "examples": [
